OHOS: translate the one new recording-save prompt this port adds to
SystemTrayController.

Screen recordings are exported through the Files document picker instead of a
plain path (see the screenrecordingcontroller/screenrecordingfolder patches);
this is the prompt that tells the user to pick a destination. The
auto-update prompts and the tray's own update/capture text that the unpatched
catalog already carries are upstream strings with no OHOS-specific behavior
change, so they are left untranslated by this port.

diff --git a/snow_shot/i18n/core/snow_shot_core_en_US.ts b/snow_shot/i18n/core/snow_shot_core_en_US.ts
index ae80472..056e59a 100644
